  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">Для версии 1.19+ обратитесь к Simply Tools, так как Vanilla Hammers был объединён с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-excavators-forge/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Excavators</a> для улучшения некоторых вещей.</span></p>\r\n<p><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vanilla_Hammers/BH_VH_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"367\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Мод Vanilla Hammers добавляет несколько молотков для Minecraft 1.14+, которые могут обрабатывать область 3x3. Молоток похож на кирку, поэтому вы можете добывать камень и руду.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Этот мод изначально был создан <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-hammers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Draylar для Fabric</a>, и я адаптировал мод для Forge, взяв все его текстуры. Надеюсь, вам понравится мод так же, как и мне во время его создания.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vanilla_Hammers/BH_VH_TypesOfHammer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/vanilla-hammers/1.18.x/images/itemgroup.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"390\"></p>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Дерево</strong></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6etwCfW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Камень</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Fk6CIkW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Железо</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rE7VZI8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Золото</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/49nwMHS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Бриллиант</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBMcXce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Кость</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/96nOufW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Уголь</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/evSGpEK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Изумруд</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IUNHov4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Эндер</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TfQxQ2L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-firental\"><strong>Огненный</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JXcO1m2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Светящийся камень</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Usq3Onq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Лазурит</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xb19sns.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Преисподняя</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SFwRXvl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Обсидиан</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1cGFWqC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Бумага</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O1V6Rio.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Призматин</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t6pyHov.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Кварц</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nHvx2HH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Редстоун</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cnXtg87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>Слизь</strong></span>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MA6oeey.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vanilla_Hammers/BH_VH_Dependencies.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morevanillalib\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreVanillaLib</a>&nbsp;</span>добавляет конфиг</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libx\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibX</a></span> 1.17+</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vanilla_Hammers/BH_VH_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"167\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#Реклама #Реклама</span></p>",
